# SDS Design System Rule

When building or modifying any UI component in this project, ALWAYS 
reference the SDS documentation in docs/design-system/sds/ before 
writing code.

Key rules:
- Never use Tailwind default colors (gray-200, blue-500, etc.) — use SDS hex values
- Never use rounded-lg/xl/2xl — use rounded-sds-* tokens
- Never use shadow-sm/md/lg — use shadow-sds-* tokens
- Page background: bg-[#F5FAFF], cards: bg-white
- Primary text: text-[#131313], secondary: text-[#4d4d4d], disabled: text-[#aaaaaa]
- Borders: border-[#e0e0e0]
- Primary blue: #0183FF, hover: #0169CC
- Font: font-darwin (Darwin Sans)
- Refer to docs/design-system/sds/COMPONENTS.md for component specs
- Refer to docs/design-system/sds/TOKENS.md for all token values